1
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,010
THE FIRST HITMAN SUMMIT
SATURDAY, JUNE 20th

2
00:01:34,510 --> 00:01:38,220
Okay, today we have 
a new transfer student.

3
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,220
Today? More like again.

4
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,930
This class gets
a lot of transfer students.

5
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:48,610
This is Eiji Rindou.
Everybody, make him feel welcome.

6
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:52,860
Goodbye, tranquility.

7
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:54,690
Hello again, assassin.

8
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:57,240
- Whoa, he's huge!
- He's really a seventh-grader?

9
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:59,410
And what's that screw in his forehead?

10
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:00,240
A fashion thing?

11
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:03,290
Wow, another character
with a lot going on!

12
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,910
Oh, what's wrong?

13
00:02:06,410 --> 00:02:08,230
Oh, no.

14
00:02:08,230 --> 00:02:09,420
He's totally my type.

15
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:10,880
No way. Seriously?

16
00:02:11,790 --> 00:02:13,130
Seriously!

17
00:02:13,420 --> 00:02:15,630
I feel like I've seen him
somewhere before.

18
00:02:17,420 --> 00:02:18,050
REPORT

19
00:02:18,050 --> 00:02:20,930
Even one assassin in a middle school
would be completely insane.

20
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,680
Nice to meet ya.

21
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,680
All right, Rindou, take your seat.

22
00:02:25,270 --> 00:02:27,230
But now four have infiltrated
the school.

23
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:29,190
We can officially call
this situation extraordinary.

24
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:32,690
Sensing the danger,
Ogami called them together...

25
00:02:33,730 --> 00:02:36,690
and held the first Hitman Summit.

26
00:02:37,610 --> 00:02:42,700
From Yugang, the second-biggest Chinese
outfit in the industry, Shin Kohazame.

27
00:02:43,370 --> 00:02:47,710
And from JARDIN, the biggest organization
in the business, the Rindou brothers.

28
00:02:50,290 --> 00:02:51,330
So, you finally showed up.

29
00:02:51,330 --> 00:02:53,210
The boss and I belong to Z.O.O.,

30
00:02:53,210 --> 00:02:55,840
the old-school outfit
ranked third in the industry.

31
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,340
I can't believe...

32
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:59,970
the three biggest organizations
are all here because of Noren.

33
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:02,800
What'd you call us here for
out of the blue?

34
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,390
You all know about each other
by now, right?

35
00:03:05,390 --> 00:03:07,980
Despite it all, let's get along!

36
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:10,650
Don't start any trouble!

37
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,230
I'm begging you!

38
00:03:13,230 --> 00:03:15,690
Why's it so important to you?

39
00:03:16,030 --> 00:03:19,700
Not that you had to tell me. I'm not
about to start killing people here.

40
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:22,160
The Mitsuoka duel's on hold for now, too.

41
00:03:22,530 --> 00:03:23,780
Same here.

42
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,240
But there's one thing.

43
00:03:26,450 --> 00:03:29,660
I can't get along with them.

44
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:32,460
Especially the little one.

45
00:03:33,210 --> 00:03:36,960
Years ago, he stole one of my targets.

46
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:40,840
Ah, that time.

47
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:43,640
That only happened because 
you were dragging your feet.

48
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:45,100
Don't give me that!

49
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:47,350
Not after the dirty trick you pulled!

50
00:03:47,350 --> 00:03:51,230
He was a special target!
I had to be the one to take him down!

51
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:57,730
Is that so? Then all the more reason you
should've killed him sooner, you half-wit!

52
00:04:04,490 --> 00:04:05,660
Don't, Eiji.

53
00:04:05,990 --> 00:04:08,540
This is between him and me.

54
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:11,370
Cut it out! When I said "get along,"
I meant everyone here!

55
00:04:11,370 --> 00:04:12,870
Were you even listening to me?

56
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:15,170
This is exactly what I mean by "trouble"!

57
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:18,550
For the record...

58
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:20,840
I'm disappointed in you, too.

59
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:21,510
Huh?

60
00:04:22,090 --> 00:04:23,680
I lost the duel...

61
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:27,180
so I backed off from Noren
for the time being.

62
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:28,180
But I heard...

63
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:28,810
FIRE HYDRANT

64
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:31,480
she was abducted from 
under your nose the other day!

65
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:34,600
Sure, she made it through safely,
but with a performance that pathetic...

66
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:37,980
I can't entrust the woman I love to you.

67
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:40,990
I won't mention who abducted her.

68
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:43,490
I'll protect Noren!

69
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:46,030
Oh! There you are, Ogami.

70
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:49,540
We don't have club today,
so let's walk home together.

71
00:04:50,910 --> 00:04:52,370
Why are you all here?

72
00:04:52,370 --> 00:04:54,420
Let's adjourn for now.

73
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,630
Don't worry.

74
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,420
First-years and third-years...

75
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:01,380
usually don't cross paths
unless they go out of their way.

76
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:02,550
Good grief.

77
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,350
Huh? My shoes are gone?

78
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,310
No way! Why?

79
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,930
Noren...

80
00:05:13,350 --> 00:05:15,480
I took the liberty
of warming them for you.

81
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,060
It's early summer!

82
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:19,150
Wait, no... Are you Toyotomi Hideyoshi?

83
00:05:19,150 --> 00:05:21,070
No, that's not the point, either!
What are you doing?

84
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:22,070
Look out!

85
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:25,820
A June beetle.

86
00:05:25,820 --> 00:05:26,700
It's harmless!

87
00:05:39,710 --> 00:05:41,750
You're walking home with us?

88
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:43,460
And you're way too close!
What is your deal?

89
00:05:43,460 --> 00:05:45,550
I want to protect you, my precious Noren!

90
00:05:45,930 --> 00:05:49,010
From now on, I'll be with you
at all times! I've made up my mind!

91
00:05:49,010 --> 00:05:49,760
Huh?

92
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:51,010
"At all times"?

93
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,850
At all times!

94
00:05:53,850 --> 00:05:55,690
While you eat, while you bathe...

95
00:05:55,690 --> 00:05:57,230
even while you sleep!

96
00:05:57,520 --> 00:06:00,520
Huh? Like I'd go along with that!
Are you stupid?

97
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:03,530
Ogami! Shin is being weird!

98
00:06:03,860 --> 00:06:05,110
Sorry.

99
00:06:05,110 --> 00:06:07,280
This is all because I failed you.

100
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:10,660
You failing me turns Shin into an idiot?

101
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:11,280
THE FIRST HITMAN SUMMIT

102
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:13,620
The first Hitman Summit results.

103
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:16,500
One... Three out of four participants
started fighting.

104
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:19,830
Two... Shin Kohazame became a stalker.

105
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:22,670
Will this report get approved?

106
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:30,470
What was that?

107
00:06:31,430 --> 00:06:32,810
You can clearly see me, jerk!

108
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,600
Sorry, I was kidding.

109
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,640
Don't pat my head!

110
00:06:40,350 --> 00:06:41,980
Did you make that yourself?

111
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:43,940
Also, your lunch box is tiny!

112
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:45,940
If it's any bigger, I can't finish it.

113
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:49,410
Even your voice is adorable!

114
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:51,780
Everybody, stop patting my head!

115
00:06:54,450 --> 00:06:56,540
Hello. I'm Mei Tamada.

116
00:06:57,290 --> 00:07:01,040
I'm a second-year in the home ec club,
which makes me Ogami and Noren's senpai.

117
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,380
Huh? You don't know me?

118
00:07:02,710 --> 00:07:04,500
Well, I guess until now...

119
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,670
I've mostly just been darting around
in the corner of the screen.

120
00:07:06,670 --> 00:07:07,300
ANPAN

121
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:09,800
Still, I'm pleased to 
make your acquaintance.

122
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,430
As for my height, it's a little...

123
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:13,760
So cute!

124
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,770
But wait a second.

125
00:07:15,770 --> 00:07:17,100
Huh? She's a second-year?

126
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:20,520
Actually, yeah. To be blunt,
I'm the smallest person in the club.

127
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:23,190
Which is why I'm here today for advice.

128
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,360
Ogami!

129
00:07:24,770 --> 00:07:25,860
Huh?

130
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:27,320
Oh, Tamada-senpai?

131
00:07:29,450 --> 00:07:30,860
What's wrong?

132
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:36,330
I wanna get ripped!

133
00:07:36,330 --> 00:07:37,370
What?

134
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:38,080
Why?

135
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:40,370
You don't want people looking down on you?

136
00:07:40,370 --> 00:07:43,080
I mean, we've never done that
before or anything.

137
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:45,420
It's not the home ec club.

138
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:49,380
I'm sick of always being the class's target.

139
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:53,140
But you're plenty charming
just the way you are.

140
00:07:53,140 --> 00:07:54,720
Easy for tall, sleek Noren to say!

141
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,600
You don't know the heart
of the vertically-challenged!

142
00:07:57,390 --> 00:08:00,430
Everybody goes, "Aww, you're so cute!"
and pats me on the head...

143
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:03,100
but I'm not somebody's pet!

144
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:04,360
I know!

145
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,520
I know nobody's doing it to be mean!

146
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:08,440
If anything, they're doting on me!

147
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:12,360
But doesn't that come with the implication
that they don't see me as an equal?

148
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,990
So, if I can't get bigger vertically...

149
00:08:13,990 --> 00:08:16,490
I'll get wider!

150
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,410
I bought dumbbells!

151
00:08:18,410 --> 00:08:20,120
How'd you decide that 
"getting ripped" is the answer?

152
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,370
Whoa, they're adjustable ones, too!

153
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:26,250
If only my shoulders...

154
00:08:26,250 --> 00:08:28,420
If only my shoulders were broader!

155
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:31,420
Shoulders have nothing to...
Wait, that mental image is nightmare fuel!

156
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:33,840
But what about the sewing
and crafts you love, Senpai?

157
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:36,010
I'm not quitting those or anything.

158
00:08:36,010 --> 00:08:38,850
I just also want melon shoulders.

159
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:40,350
Melon shoulders?

160
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:43,850
Okay, I get the situation,
but why come to me?

161
00:08:43,850 --> 00:08:46,560
Sorry. Actually,
it's not exactly you I need.

162
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:49,530
I want you to introduce me to Tenma Tendo.

163
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:50,820
Huh?

164
00:08:50,820 --> 00:08:52,450
If I'm gonna ask someone how to train...

165
00:08:52,450 --> 00:08:55,450
it should be the man
with the ultimate physical body, right?

166
00:08:55,450 --> 00:08:59,120
You went from getting ripped
to asking him for help?

167
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:03,750
But there's a very real chance
that guy doesn't even know I exist!

168
00:09:03,750 --> 00:09:04,370
DELICIOUS MILK

169
00:09:04,370 --> 00:09:05,250
So, I figured you could...

170
00:09:05,250 --> 00:09:07,540
I mean, I don't know
what you expect me to...

171
00:09:10,250 --> 00:09:11,380
Please!

172
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:13,220
I wanna get huge!

173
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:17,470
Fine, I get it! Just stop doing
shoulder presses for your delts!

174
00:09:19,470 --> 00:09:22,060
Ogami and a home ec club
member? What's up?

175
00:09:22,350 --> 00:09:24,600
Huh? You know me?

176
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,400
Uh, I don't know your name,
but I know your face.

177
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:30,650
The home ec club people have,
I dunno, a special vibe.

178
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:32,320
So, what do you need?

179
00:09:32,650 --> 00:09:34,150
Let's sit down first!

180
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:35,660
Your crotch is right there!

181
00:09:36,110 --> 00:09:39,490
You wanna bulk up
so people won't look down on you?

182
00:09:39,490 --> 00:09:41,040
Sounds pointless. I'd quit.

183
00:09:42,410 --> 00:09:45,580
I mean, I can give you
workout advice, sure.

184
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:48,170
But getting a little bigger
isn't gonna change anything.

185
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:50,670
If Ogami or I got serious...

186
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:53,130
either way, it'd be a one-punch KO.

187
00:09:55,050 --> 00:09:57,970
So, the problem
probably isn't really that. Oh?

188
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:59,180
Huh?

189
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:00,430
Could you say it any worse?

190
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,190
Um, Tamada-senpai...

191
00:10:12,730 --> 00:10:15,700
The people who actually see you
for who you are don't look down on you.

192
00:10:16,070 --> 00:10:17,740
I know that.

193
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:20,780
It's just, both my parents
are short, too...

194
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:22,830
so when I think that...

195
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,870
I might spend the rest of my life
being treated like a small animal...

196
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:28,790
unless I constantly assert myself...
it seems like such a pain in the ass.

197
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:32,670
In that case, after school...

198
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:37,840
would you maybe come with me
to my uncle's, no, aunt's shop?

199
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:40,340
OPEN 24 HOURS

200
00:10:40,340 --> 00:10:42,680
Welcome, Juzo!

201
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,310
BAR JABAMI

202
00:10:43,310 --> 00:10:46,850
So, this is the senpai from your club
you mentioned? Nice to meet you!

203
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:51,520
S-S-So huge!

204
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,900
Even bigger than Tenma!

205
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:57,280
Forget being face-to-crotch, I could
just walk under there like a bridge!

206
00:10:57,820 --> 00:10:59,110
Um...

207
00:10:59,110 --> 00:11:00,780
a giant warrior god?

208
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,990
Opening with that, huh?

209
00:11:03,990 --> 00:11:06,040
I'll burn you to the ground!

210
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:08,660
Sorry, Mama. I know you're not open yet.

211
00:11:08,660 --> 00:11:10,920
Oh, this time of day's totally fine.

212
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:11,540
BAR JABAMI

213
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:13,880
Well, anyway, come on in!

214
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:14,960
Thanks.

215
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,420
Am I getting out alive?

216
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:18,840
BAR JABAMI

217
00:11:20,890 --> 00:11:23,680
What's wrong with that?
Being tiny and cute is great.

218
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:25,890
But that's exactly what you hate about it?

219
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:30,350
What do you have to eat to get that huge?

220
00:11:30,350 --> 00:11:32,940
Hell if I know! Meat, probably?

221
00:11:34,110 --> 00:11:35,400
Well, sure.

222
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:39,150
I can't say people have ever really
looked down on me.

223
00:11:40,070 --> 00:11:43,990
And if they did, I'd beat 'em senseless.

224
00:11:43,990 --> 00:11:44,660
Beat?

225
00:11:45,030 --> 00:11:49,410
So, yeah, I've never felt the way you do.

226
00:11:49,410 --> 00:11:51,000
I don't get it.

227
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:52,630
What do you think?

228
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:54,000
Jealous?

229
00:11:55,290 --> 00:11:56,800
Yes.

230
00:11:57,170 --> 00:11:58,550
But...

231
00:11:58,550 --> 00:12:01,010
I'm jealous of you.

232
00:12:02,380 --> 00:12:05,640
I would've much rather
been born a cute girl...

233
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:09,640
than in this crazy strong male body
nobody dares come near.

234
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:13,850
You've got something even invincible
old me could never have.

235
00:12:13,850 --> 00:12:16,520
So, quit whining
like it's some horrible curse!

236
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:22,360
Table for two! We'll start with highballs!

237
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:24,490
Not regulars.

238
00:12:24,490 --> 00:12:27,330
And how are they already wasted
at this hour?

239
00:12:27,330 --> 00:12:30,410
Sorry, we're not open yet!

240
00:12:30,410 --> 00:12:32,830
Oh, c'mon! We're customers!

241
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,330
Wait, hold up!

242
00:12:34,330 --> 00:12:36,750
Now that I get a good look, you're a kid!

243
00:12:36,750 --> 00:12:39,090
What're you doing in a place like this?

244
00:12:47,220 --> 00:12:47,930
Hey...

245
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:51,020
That's my ideal girl you're messing with.

246
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:52,940
Don't get handsy.

247
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:56,940
If you're that drunk,
how about I kill you so you sober up?

248
00:13:04,530 --> 00:13:06,070
Sorry about this!

249
00:13:06,070 --> 00:13:09,740
Looks like I've gotta deal
with some new customers for a minute.

250
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:11,080
Come visit again, okay?

251
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:13,210
Y-Yes, ma'am!

252
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:19,340
S-So scary!

253
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:21,340
What kind of place did you bring me to?

254
00:13:21,340 --> 00:13:23,550
Sorry, that last part wasn't in the plan!

255
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:25,800
I got freaked out six different ways!

256
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:38,020
I can't! This is all so insane, I don't
even know what else to do but laugh!

257
00:13:41,650 --> 00:13:43,190
I heard, Ogami!

258
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:47,160
You took Tama to some crazy bar?

259
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:49,620
Sorry.

260
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:52,290
So, they went to that place.

261
00:13:52,290 --> 00:13:54,370
No, but it was fun!

262
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:57,710
Thanks to that, I kinda stopped
caring about a bunch of stuff.

263
00:13:58,290 --> 00:13:59,340
Thanks.

264
00:14:01,710 --> 00:14:03,550
I'm still gonna work out, though.

265
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,970
Lateral raises!

266
00:14:07,050 --> 00:14:10,470
This happened after Tamada-senpai
did her lateral raises.

267
00:14:10,470 --> 00:14:11,890
HOME EC ROOM

268
00:14:11,890 --> 00:14:12,560
Okay, then!

269
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:15,430
We'll be splitting into teams of two
for a full-on ramen-making challenge!

270
00:14:15,430 --> 00:14:18,810
And then we'll hold a contest to decide
which team's ramen tastes the best!

271
00:14:21,770 --> 00:14:23,610
Yay! Sounds fun!

272
00:14:23,610 --> 00:14:27,610
What is it about ramen
that just gets you excited?

273
00:14:27,610 --> 00:14:28,610
Right?

274
00:14:29,110 --> 00:14:30,320
What?

275
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:32,030
Ramen?

276
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:33,450
Noren?

277
00:14:34,370 --> 00:14:35,660
Oh, my!

278
00:14:35,660 --> 00:14:36,960
Well...

279
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,420
this is awkward!

280
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:40,210
Looks like my era has arrived!

281
00:14:40,210 --> 00:14:43,710
She's getting crazy cocky already!
What era is she talking about?

282
00:14:43,710 --> 00:14:45,550
I feel bad for everyone else,

283
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:49,510
but I guess this is when the difference
between amateurs and a pro will really show!

284
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:51,800
You're acting all high and mighty,
but aren't you...

285
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:54,010
still just an apprentice
at your uncle's shop?

286
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:56,810
So, the teams are set.

287
00:14:57,230 --> 00:14:58,020
TEAMS: NISHIMURA-SHIRAISHI KOHAZAME-YAMAOKA
TAMADA-KITO OGAMI-MITSUOKA

288
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:00,940
Presentations are one week from now!

289
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:04,280
Use that time to research,
test recipes, whatever you need!

290
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:07,740
Oh, come to think of it,
you like ramen, don't you?

291
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:08,700
Yes!

292
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:09,700
I'll do my best!

293
00:15:10,030 --> 00:15:12,030
You like ramen, too, Noren?

294
00:15:12,030 --> 00:15:12,870
- Huh?
- Huh?

295
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:16,330
As it happens, I'm rather particular
about Chinese cuisine.

296
00:15:16,330 --> 00:15:18,830
I simply can't afford to cut corners.

297
00:15:19,290 --> 00:15:21,960
I do love you, Noren...

298
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,670
but this time, well...

299
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:25,130
I'm sorry.

300
00:15:25,130 --> 00:15:26,170
Oh...

301
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:27,420
Huh?

302
00:15:27,420 --> 00:15:28,340
Wait.

303
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:29,760
Sorry for what?

304
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:33,470
Are you saying,
"Sorry, but I'm going to win"?

305
00:15:33,470 --> 00:15:35,350
Yes. I'm sorry.

306
00:15:35,350 --> 00:15:36,600
What?

307
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:39,100
No, no, no, hold on a second!

308
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:41,730
I don't know how many thousands
of years China's got on us,

309
00:15:41,730 --> 00:15:44,190
but ramen evolved
in its own unique way here in Japan!

310
00:15:44,190 --> 00:15:46,070
At this point,
it's a proud genre all its own.

311
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:50,070
So, don't go acting superior
just because you got there first.

312
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:52,700
It is precisely because 
we got there first.

313
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:55,030
I acknowledge that ramen has evolved
in its own unique way.

314
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:57,700
But in terms of depth and breadth,
it still has a long way to go.

315
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,830
When something is still immature,

316
00:15:59,830 --> 00:16:02,880
it shouldn't strut around
pretending to be fully grown.

317
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:05,840
You're talking awfully big!

318
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:08,550
I can't wait to hear the excuse
when you lose!

319
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:10,670
I apologized in advance
because I won't lose.

320
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:13,470
That's not an apology!

321
00:16:13,470 --> 00:16:15,300
That's trash talk!

322
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:17,560
I don't want to make you cry.

323
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:19,270
Please back down.

324
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,730
Very well.

325
00:16:20,730 --> 00:16:22,350
Then this means war.

326
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:23,980
Noren?

327
00:16:24,310 --> 00:16:25,360
Noren?

328
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,610
It's a showdown!

329
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:28,570
If I win, you stop stalking me!

330
00:16:28,570 --> 00:16:33,070
Calm down! That's not a prize,
that's the bare minimum!

331
00:16:33,070 --> 00:16:33,990
I accept!

332
00:16:33,990 --> 00:16:36,910
And if I win, you must read me
a picture book!

333
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:40,700
Your weird little fantasies
are getting way too specific!

334
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:44,330
Now that that's settled, let's go, Ogami!

335
00:16:44,330 --> 00:16:46,130
We're eating our way through 
ramen shops for research!

336
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,960
Me, too! Yamaoka, come with me!

337
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:51,420
Hey! Club's still in session!

338
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,760
- Might as well.
- Yes, ma'am.

339
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:57,760
This has turned into a 
massive pain in the ass.

340
00:17:01,890 --> 00:17:03,730
Okay, on to the next shop!

341
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,690
Wait...

342
00:17:05,690 --> 00:17:06,730
Noren...

343
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:09,270
How many places are we hitting?

344
00:17:09,980 --> 00:17:12,320
I'm about to...

345
00:17:12,650 --> 00:17:13,860
explode.

346
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:14,820
What?

347
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:16,490
We're only on number eight!

348
00:17:16,490 --> 00:17:19,950
Eight bowls is a borderline lethal dose!

349
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:22,410
Then I'll go by myself!

350
00:17:22,410 --> 00:17:23,580
You head home!

351
00:17:24,870 --> 00:17:27,960
How could she eat all that
and still run normally?

352
00:17:28,250 --> 00:17:32,970
One more bite, and I'll burst!

353
00:17:34,970 --> 00:17:37,220
I'll rest for a minute.

354
00:17:45,850 --> 00:17:47,480
THE OCEAN

355
00:18:02,450 --> 00:18:03,750
Are you okay?

356
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:04,910
Y-Yes!

357
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:07,750
Thank you very much!

358
00:18:09,290 --> 00:18:10,840
Good to hear!

359
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:11,920
Crap, I'm gonna puke!

360
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:14,170
U-Um...

361
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:19,470
I'm so sorry!

362
00:18:20,010 --> 00:18:21,180
Are you all right?

363
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:22,430
Are you hurt?

364
00:18:23,180 --> 00:18:25,140
THE DAY OF THE CHAMPIONSHIP

365
00:18:25,850 --> 00:18:29,770
The home ec club
ramen championship begins now!

366
00:18:29,770 --> 00:18:31,320
All right!

367
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:33,900
By the way, to keep the judging fair,

368
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:37,070
a girl who just happened to be
 walking by will be the judge!

369
00:18:37,610 --> 00:18:39,320
Sorry to spring this on you.

370
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:40,910
No, not at all.

371
00:18:40,910 --> 00:18:42,780
I like ramen, so...

372
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:46,290
Then first up, the Kohazame-Yamaoka team!

373
00:18:46,290 --> 00:18:49,790
Behold a ramen beyond your imagination!

374
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:50,500
BIANGBIANG NOODLES

375
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:52,000
Biangbiang noodles!

376
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:55,800
What? That kanji's beyond
my imagination anyway! I can't read it!

377
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:58,840
It's a local dish from 
Shaanxi Province in China,

378
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,970
made with extremely wide, flat noodles...

379
00:19:00,970 --> 00:19:03,720
somewhat like kishimen,
tossed with sauce and toppings.

380
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:06,850
W-Wow! This is a real thing?

381
00:19:08,020 --> 00:19:10,440
And to make it even more satisfying,

382
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:14,900
we made the noodles three times
the usual width and thickness!

383
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:17,030
Now!

384
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:18,400
Please enjoy!

385
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:32,170
I can't...

386
00:19:32,170 --> 00:19:33,380
enjoy this!

387
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:36,760
The noodles are too heavy
to actually eat! Zero points!

388
00:19:37,090 --> 00:19:39,260
Z-Zero?

389
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:44,560
All talk, Shin!

390
00:19:44,560 --> 00:19:45,970
I can't stop laughing!

391
00:19:45,970 --> 00:19:48,930
This match is mine!

392
00:19:48,930 --> 00:19:50,690
Who are you right now?

393
00:19:50,690 --> 00:19:51,770
Next up!

394
00:19:51,770 --> 00:19:53,690
The Mitsuoka-Ogami team!

395
00:19:53,690 --> 00:19:54,310
RAMEN NOTES

396
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:57,730
I have sampled every genre
of ramen imaginable...

397
00:19:57,730 --> 00:20:01,700
and at last arrived
at the ultimate ramen!

398
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,700
"Arrived," have we?

399
00:20:03,490 --> 00:20:04,740
Please enjoy!

400
00:20:04,740 --> 00:20:08,330
Tonkotsu Iekei Black Soy Sauce
Salt Miso Tantan...

401
00:20:08,330 --> 00:20:10,790
Kitakata Seafood Pork Bone
Chicken Paitan...

402
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:15,040
Garlic Veggie Extra-Extra Karame
Abura Chomolungma!

403
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:18,260
Is that a curse? Isn't that mostly
just ramen-shop ordering lingo?

404
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:20,380
Kill... me...

405
00:20:20,380 --> 00:20:24,600
That isn't ramen anymore, it's a chimera!
A violent assault of salt, sugar, and fat!

406
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:26,970
If I were in my original body,
that thing would give me...

407
00:20:26,970 --> 00:20:28,560
every lifestyle disease in the book!

408
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:30,140
Kill me!

409
00:20:30,140 --> 00:20:31,810
Okay, time for the tasting!

410
00:20:31,810 --> 00:20:33,560
I'm sorry!

411
00:20:34,190 --> 00:20:35,860
I really can't!

412
00:20:35,860 --> 00:20:37,400
I'm so sorry!

413
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:39,570
Yeah, fair! Sorry about that! Zero points!

414
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:42,450
CHEER
CHEER

415
00:20:42,450 --> 00:20:43,820
All right, moving on!

416
00:20:44,110 --> 00:20:47,280
In the end, Big Sis and Nishimura won.

417
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:48,290
We did it!

418
00:20:48,290 --> 00:20:50,950
Hell yeah! That's what senpais do!

419
00:20:50,950 --> 00:20:52,330
ALL RAMEN WAS SAFELY CONSUMED
BY THE STAFF AFTERWARD.

420
00:20:54,750 --> 00:20:55,960
Thanks!

421
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,630
And sorry we dragged you into this.

422
00:20:57,630 --> 00:21:00,010
No, I had fun.

423
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:04,550
M-More importantly, actually, there's
something I'd like to talk to you about.

424
00:21:04,890 --> 00:21:05,720
Huh?

425
00:21:06,850 --> 00:21:07,510
Wait.

426
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:10,680
Aren't you the girl I helped the other day?

427
00:21:11,220 --> 00:21:13,020
Yes, that's right!

428
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:14,940
A-And, um...

429
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:17,360
Ogami...

430
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:19,150
there's something I need to tell you.

431
00:21:20,150 --> 00:21:24,280
Would it be okay if I let the other one
take over and went to sleep?

432
00:21:26,820 --> 00:21:27,820
Huh?

433
00:21:29,870 --> 00:21:31,330
Excuse me?

434
00:21:41,210 --> 00:21:42,130
Huh?

435
00:21:42,130 --> 00:21:43,880
Wait, what?

436
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:45,630
What does that even mean?

437
00:21:45,630 --> 00:21:47,760
Why did she suddenly fall asleep?

438
00:22:07,610 --> 00:22:09,990
Thanks for waiting.

